# Branch 20260801 tracks the runtime state on purpose, so that a clone reproduces the rehearsal
# exactly: data/, nodes/, demo_nodes/, demo_videos/ and the mirrored MediaPipe binaries are all
# committed here. That is a deliberate departure from main, where they are ignored.
#
# Only two things stay out, because committing them would make a clone WORSE, not better:
#   .venv/       platform-specific binaries with absolute paths baked in; it would not run on
#                another machine anyway, and `uv sync` rebuilds it exactly from uv.lock
#   __pycache__/ regenerated bytecode
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
